Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm wasting away over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we visit my bro's grave, Dave,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you say we find a\Nplace to get something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good, but don't let me stop you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.30,0:00:39.68,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Italian Cuisine: Trussardi, 100 meters to the right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Says here there's a new Italian\Nrestaurant, and it's just up the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that where the cemetery is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the best place for a restaurant,\Nor anything for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Josuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is just the kind of wacky food destination\Nthat brings people in from all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's to die for!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mouth won't stop watering!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or whatever it is the Fats\Nsay, I just want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Josuke, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it?
