Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought this building was vacant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they remodeled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure has character.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.05,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Today's Course: Depends on the customer. Includes coffee and dessert - 3,500 yen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's diner dependent mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm digging the vibe\Nthis place has going on.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.35,0:01:22.77,Main,Okuyasu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Inside ain't too shabby, neither!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.77,0:01:24.60,Main,Tonio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Greetings!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Benvenuto.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.77,0:01:29.40,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,562)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 10: {\fs80} Let's Go Eat Some Italian Food
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.77,0:01:29.40,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,562)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 10: {\fs80} Let's Go out for Italian
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, please feel free to have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So chef, you a foreigner or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Si, signore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am originally from Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Tonio Trussardi,\Nbut you can call me Tonio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best day ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally get to eat\Nauthentic Italian food!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My role as a chef has\Ntaken me to many countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've used the flavors\Nof my homeland and fused
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them with the best culinary\Ntraditions in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've made my way to Japan\Nin search of new opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Mariah is such a magnificent town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.34,0:02:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can find several farms with\Nmany kinds of fresh produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its fruity de mari are great too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.14,0:02:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I adore it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using Morio's wonderful ingredients,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I plan to make you a meal that will tickle\Nthe taste buds and delight your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.19,0:02:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I should order?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'll choose after\Nyou show us the menu. Menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we don't use those. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of restaurant doesn't use menus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I serve depends on\Nthe patron I'm serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're serving\Nme, and I want the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I have to examine the customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I decide what to prepare for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't let your customers choose\Nwhat they want to eat for themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had diarrhea yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your intestinal walls are inflamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's obvious you're sleep deprived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you only got four hours last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which of course explains the puffy eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's see your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your right foot is infected with a fungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You also have two cavities and\Nyour left shoulder is stiff, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you know all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything you said\Nwas right on the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all in the hands, amigo mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are like a window into your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what will you be having, signore?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not all that hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll take a cup of\Ncoffee if you have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it a cappuccino.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ho Capt, signore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy can talk up his fancy\Ndishes as much as he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Healthy food tastes like dog shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's even a little disgusting,\Nwe don't have to pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can just complain and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, this water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wait, it has to be\Nmineral water. What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been as totally sure about\Nsomething as I am right this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best water\Nthat I've ever tasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's overflowing with sophistication!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like something a\Nmountain princess playing a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,harp would drink as she\Nstrums a beautiful melody!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wonderfully fresh and smooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the glorious first taste of water after\Nwandering in the desert for three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! Yeah! You weren't\Njoking! It's amazing!
