Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's first-rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they'll tell us\Nwhat brand of water it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this water's so good, I think I'm actually\Ngoing to shed a few tears over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little sip of water isn't worth\Nweeping over no matter how good it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:04:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be its purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a handkerchief on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The waterworks are in full force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tears just keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't stop.
