Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to freak you out even more,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the white parts of your eyes\Nare getting all shriveled and loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please try to remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell did you give Okuyasu to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tranquilo, signore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes have only been\Ntemporarily withered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had 50,000-year-old\Nmineral water made from
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,melted snow procured from\NMount Kilimanjaro in Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It flushes the ice interior\Nof harmful contaminants and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is an effective treatment in\Ncases of sleep deprivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason you didn't cry\Nafter drinking the water is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you obtained an adequate\Namount of sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sleepy anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be perfectly honest with\Nyou, I feel spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I slept a full ten hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.34,0:06:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me there's\Nnothing wrong with your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you drink water this good, it's\Nonly natural for the tears to flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Josuke, it's\Nnothing to be worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cried way more than this\Nwhen I watched Champ on video.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for Karen, but I\Nfeel like a billion yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet your ass it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your cappuccino.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, shall we continue\Nwith the next course?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, looks grum-diddly-yumptious.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.75,0:06:49.51,Episode 10 Typesetting 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(1360,1043,1387.2,1043)\u1\fs50}Ingredients:{\u0}\N{\fs40}• Mozzarella cheese (4 thin slices)\N• Tomatoes (5 thin slices)\N\N{\u1\fs50}Tonio's Special Dressing:{\u0}\N{\fs40}• 1 Anchovy • Seaweed • Olive oil\N• White wine vinegar \N• Lemon juice • Salt • Pepper \N• Balsamic vinegar (just a splash) \N• Toast • Lettuce (for garnish)\N(Best eaten within 15 minutes\N of preparation)
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.13,0:06:49.51,Main,Tonio,0,0,0,,{\an8}For the antipasto, we have a salad \Nwith slices of mozzarella cheese and tomato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For our antipasto, I've prepared\Ninsalata caprese with mozzarella.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but what's Masazo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, you've never\Nheard of mozzarella before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a soft, low-fat\Ncheese that's quite tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:07:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a national favorite in Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first people to use tomatoes as a\Nculinary ingredient were the Italians.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Italian people lead the entire world\Nwhen it comes to tomato based cuisine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We take pride in our work
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I hope you enjoy\Nyour meal, sir. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this dish is pretty\Ngood. I'll give you that I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dare say this is very good\Nbut even so the cheese itself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't leave much of an\Nimpression which is a shame after
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the hype no no it's not\Nmeant to be eaten by itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have to add tomato to it. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adding a tomato sounds weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right, but here in\NJapan, we have sensitive palates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna have to be\Nmind-blowing to pass the tasty test.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:07:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.24,0:08:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredible how the tomatoey nectar\Ngently caresses the fresh, delicate cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a great combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cheese and tomato enrich each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect symphony, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A harmony of tantalizing flavors, A dynamic\Nduo the likes of Simon and Garfunkel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or even Abbott and Costello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the writer-illustrator\Nteam Osuo Takamori
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.89,0:08:31.61,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: Manga about an orphaned young man trying to become a world-champion boxer.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.89,0:08:31.61,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: Japanese comic about an orphaned young man trying to become a world-champion boxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Tetsuya Chiba from the\Ncomic Ashta no Joe! Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes me happier than\Nknowing you enjoyed my cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old buddy, old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can share some\Nof that with your bestie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can order your own\Nas a salad, Konichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting any\Nof mine, you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you were starving to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still wouldn't give you a\Npiece of this yummy goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything I've been through has been\Nworth it to get beat at this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you were a stingy son of a\Nbitch, but this takes it to a new level!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will have the same thing he's having.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pocopito.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.95,0:09:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only one getting his\Nstiff shoulder corrected
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today will be the gentleman\Nsitting to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stiff shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am starting to get a little\Nbit hot under the collar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and for some reason I'm all sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Signore, might I humbly\Nsuggest you remove your jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I so itchy all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all this flaky stuff\Nsticking to my fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Semplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dead skin. Dead skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is proof that we've greatly improved\Nyour metabolic function and circulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The calcium,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:09:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vitamins and minerals of the\Nantipasto have stimulated
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your thyroid and its\Nmetabolic hormone secretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The harmful cells are being\Nexpelled as dead skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is why you've been overcome\Nwith an itching sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Molto Bone, signore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep scratching like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because at the rate you're going, the\Ndead skin will be gone in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, you have to cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dead skin's the size of a softball!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're digging into your\Nshoulder's muscle now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so limber!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shoulder's crazy flexible now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so springy and light,\Nit's almost like I'm floating!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, my shoulders have never been\Nsupple enough to bend around like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like I don't\Nhave any bones at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stiffness I had is good and gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me, I'll be\Nheading back to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pasta isn't going to get up and\Nserve itself while we stand here and chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, he's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should come here to eat more often!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting way too freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is something seriously\Nweird about this guy's cooking.
