Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.49,0:11:28.50,Episode 10 Typesetting 1b,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1127,310)}Italian Ristorante Trussardi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we continue with the next dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the primo piatto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spaghetti alla puttanesca.
