Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.33,0:12:10.37,Episode 10 Typesetting 5a,,0,0,0,,{=25}{\fade(255,0,255,-13260,-13260,-860,40)\be0.5\pos(1166.28,472.14)}NAPLES
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have said that earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't eat anything spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only kind of curry\Nrice I can handle is that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mild Vermont curry that\Nhas apples and honey in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and don't get me started\Non wasabi with sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it! It's too spicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like eating fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a simple solution, then. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's not to your liking,\Ndon't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be more than happy to\Nremove the pasta from your bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me,\NI'll prepare the main course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope the secondo piato\Nwill suit you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But so you know, signore,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make my spaghetti to\Nbe enjoyed even by those
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who have the lowest\Ntolerance for spicy foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can eat this even though it's spicy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Tonio's a master chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody with taste buds would agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you ask me, I'd even\Nsay the guy's a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this really wasn't his best work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I think you lucked out\Nwith your spice intolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hasn't it crossed your mind that this food\Nand water might be a little too weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by shady?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spicy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scratched off a\Nsoftball-sized wad of dead skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's after you\Ncried a freaking river.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that time I went to\NShirabu Onsen in Yamagata,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost even more dead\Nskin than I did today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my back got better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally normal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.18,0:13:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what I said about that little\Nchat with Hazamada in the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but it\Nseems that stand users...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said stand users are\Ninadvertently drawn to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, are you really trying to\Ntell me Tonio's a stand user? Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't say for sure yet, which is why\NI chose the word shady. Got it. Shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.18,0:14:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it so hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't handle spicy food,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe you should quit trying to\Nstuff it in your mouth already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should just give up on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spicy food and meat don't\Nmix at all. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, I can't stop\Ntasting this delicious sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.22,0:14:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you eating that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't usually be able to\Nchow down on anything just spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that first bite, the\Nspice bit back and won't let go!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.60,0:14:50.66,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: A festival where beans are thrown to ward off evil spirits,\Nthen each person eats the number of beans corresponding to their age.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like eating your age\Nin beans during a festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even though they don't taste good,\Nbefore you know it, you've eaten a whole bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you don't regret a damn thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because all you can feel\Nis your body wanting more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you to stop eating that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it, but\NI'm getting even hungrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more spaghetti I ate, the\Nmore that I want to scarf down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit! Your tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the cavity I had!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rotten tooth just fell out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think one of the\Nbottom teeth had a cavity, too. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right, another rotten tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a new molar is already growing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to find out what that\Nchef from hell's planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:15:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Shining Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't done with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ruin the meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm reverting the ingredients\Nback to their original forms!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what in the world were\Nthose little things, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So my hunch was right after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony Otrendy's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sleepiness is finally gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stiffness melted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my cavities were replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my stomach hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.38,0:16:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never felt such\Nexcruciating pain in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on! Tonio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's already finished our main course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excelente.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from this, it appears my main dish\Nof lamb with apple relish was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you think\Nyou're doing back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer the question, per favore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you enter my kitchen to spy on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now prepare yourself, signore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to pay dearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me one good reason\Nwhy I should stand here and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,listen to you hurl around\Nthreats about making me pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should threaten you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what the hell are you trying\Nto do with that food of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, wait a sec,\Nwhat are you eating now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it, my stomach\Nhurts, but I can't stop eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tangy sweet apple relish\Ncombined with juice from
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the lambs makes every\Nsingle morsel pure ecstasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew food could taste\Nthis finger-licking good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.06,0:18:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the love of God, drop the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best day ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a waterfall of\Npleasure washing over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guts fell out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach's dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle Yasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm putting an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wash your disgusting hands\Nwith softness instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, entering a kitchen\Nwithout permission is inexcusable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ascolti, cleanliness in the\Nkitchen is priority one, amico mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wash my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like my insides\Nhave been rejuvenated!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that, I'm completely\Nfull and feel as fit as a fiddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And best of all, my diarrhea\Ntummy's all better! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my, that's wonderful to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love knowing that my cooking brought\Nhappiness and health to a customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me when I tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no greater sense of joy and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,accomplishment for me than\Nnurturing a hungry soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The puppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With such unconventional flavors,\NI wanted him to taste testy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our furry friend here was having\Na bit of a digestive problem, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you mean, you just wanted\NOkuyasu to eat a good meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have ulterior motives? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else could a chef want from a\Npatron but for them to enjoy the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought gets me out\Nof bed in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.84,0:20:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's everything I could ever hope for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to be clear, you're a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A while back I was traveling the\Nworld in search of the perfect cuisine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when out of the blue I discovered\NI had these fantastical powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never in my wildest dreams would I have\Nthought I'd meet others similar to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, that's no excuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to possess common sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You touched my kitchen without\Nwashing your filthy hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I was cross with you earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's because I'm aware that the\Nkitchen's worst enemy is germs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't even cross my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready to put in some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.72,0:20:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we continue the cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dessert is... pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.41,0:21:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too manly for this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll eat it, but it\Ndoesn't mean I'm gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brilliant artist! Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuck it up, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds as though he's enjoying dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kitchen isn't going to scrub itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, this is the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My athlete's foot is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.26,0:21:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall await your return, my new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Molte Crazy.
