Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:21:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless I'm mistaken, you're Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with the Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.08,0:22:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you hear otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any electrical wiring including\Nphone lines poses a threat
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's why I've come to\Ndeliver this message in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At noon tomorrow I expect to\Narrive in the port of Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.93,0:22:54.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.00,0:22:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anytime I need to see a\Nface, it has closed my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.31,0:22:56.56,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am taken to a place\Nwith a crystal mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.56,0:22:59.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.76,0:22:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A magenta feeling. Take a\Nshelter in the face of my spine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.35,0:23:01.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.54,0:23:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight like a Chaka cherry cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to\Nexplain, I just hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.02,0:23:03.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.40,0:23:05.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.54,0:23:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,\NI'ma move so slightly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.78,0:23:08.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the human kind of all\Nthat I need, I want to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.57,0:23:10.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.10,0:23:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.28,0:23:12.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.53,0:23:14.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.60,0:23:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.87,0:23:16.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.49,0:23:19.12,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.12,0:23:23.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.63,0:23:27.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I got to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.88,0:23:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
